  "limitations": [
    "Readiness callback on Simulator is GPU command completion/readiness, not evidence of drawable display or physical pixels.",
    "Window capture includes capture cost and may return after the fixed 100 ms deadline; correct=true with observed>100 ms remains FAIL.",
    "Undo is immediately issued after eraser lift without waiting for the cut. The original whole line can satisfy the pixel oracle before a ready callback; null readiness means not recorded in that phase, not zero latency.",
    "All phase timings use each native test phase ContinuousClock origin before input, not video PTS or physical input timestamps.",
    "Four cycles per variant are a bounded negative control, not a distributional performance proof, 10-journey acceptance or 30-minute session."
